        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Detect currently-running musl runtime version.

This is done by checking the specified executable&apos;s dynamic linking
information, and invoking the loader to parse its output for a version
string. If the loader is musl, the output would be something like::

    musl libc (x86_64)
    Version 1.2.2
    Dynamic Program Loader
</verbatim> </para>
